  "question": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{C}_6 \\mathrm{H}_6(\\mathrm{liq})+\\frac{15}{2} \\mathrm{O}_2(\\mathrm{~g}) \\rightarrow 6 \\mathrm{CO}_2(\\mathrm{~g})+3 \\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}(\\mathrm{liq})$\nBenzene burns in oxygen according to the above equation. What is the volume of oxygen (at STP) needed for complete combustion of 39 gram of liquid benzene?",
